{"id":"cba7e4db2a363792","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-choice-axioms.md","title":"Definition — 选择公理与内部选择公理","display":"Definition — 选择公理与内部选择公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-choice-axioms","aliases":["14-df-choice-axioms"],"display":"Definition — 选择公理与内部选择公理","source_ref":"VI.1, pp.274–275; VI.4, pp.291–296","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-exponentials]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-choice-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-choice-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 选择公理与内部选择公理"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VI.1, pp.274–275; VI.4, pp.291–296"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a> 的指数选择、求值和转置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:X\\to Y\">\\(p:X\\to Y\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^A:X^A\\to Y^A\">\\(p^A:X^A\\to Y^A\\)</span> 为下式构造的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}\">\\(\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}\\)</span> 的源对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^A\">\\(X^A\\)</span>、指数参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p^A\\coloneqq\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}\\left(p\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{X,A}:X^A\\times A\\to Y\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p^A\\coloneqq\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}\\left(p\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{X,A}:X^A\\times A\\to Y\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\exists s:Y\\to X\\;p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\exists s:Y\\to X\\;p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p^A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p^A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>指数泛性质保证所写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^A\">\\(p^A\\)</span> 存在唯一；它在任意参数对象上的广义元素作用是后合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\mapsto p\\circ k\">\\(k\\mapsto p\\circ k\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 有截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，指数函子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^As^A=(ps)^A=1\">\\(p^As^A=(ps)^A=1\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^A\">\\(p^A\\)</span> 为分裂满态射，进而为满态射。这证明最后的蕴含。两个条件不能当作定义上的同义词：IAC 只要求指数保满态射，不直接选择全局截面。原书进一步讨论 Diaconescu 的 IAC 蕴含 Boolean 性；此处不把该深一层结论当成未经展开的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，VI.1, pp.274–275; VI.4, pp.291–296。原稿记录另曾读取 DjVu 第143图页的 VI.1 印刷275页，核对 AC、IAC 与 AC 蕴含 IAC 的陈述；指数箭头为<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a>泛性质的内建展开。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，固定 [[14-df-exponentials]] 的指数选择、求值和转置。$A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，$p:X\\to Y$；$p^A:X^A\\to Y^A$ 为下式构造的箭头。$\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}$ 的源对象为 $X^A$、指数参数为 $A$、目标为 $Y$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，VI.1, pp.274–275; VI.4, pp.291–296。原稿记录另曾读取 DjVu 第143图页的 VI.1 印刷275页，核对 AC、IAC 与 AC 蕴含 IAC 的陈述；指数箭头为[[14-df-exponentials]]泛性质的内建展开。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"p:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"p^A:X^A\\to Y^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"X^A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"p^A\\coloneqq\\Lambda_{X^A;A,Y}\\left(p\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{X,A}:X^A\\times A\\to Y\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\exists s:Y\\to X\\;p\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall p:X\\to Y\\;(\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsEpi}(p^A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AC}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E).","display":true},{"tex":"p^A","display":false},{"tex":"k\\mapsto p\\circ k","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"p^As^A=(ps)^A=1","display":false},{"tex":"p^A","display":false}],"bytes":2538,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms|df-223 — 选择公理与内部选择公理]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms|df-223 — 选择公理与内部选择公理]]"},{"id":"1d4177d202e67eb5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。"},{"id":"4fb22144b0e10ac9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，满足 [[14-df-choice-axioms]] 的 $\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)$。$p:X\\to Y$ 为满态射，有限积和指数均已选定。$\\pi_Y,\\pi_U$ 是 $Y\\times U$ 的投影。"}],"outgoing":["8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","4fc4fd1ccffdbab5"]}